WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:09.260
In January, six men allegedly raped and
murdered a Muslim shepherd girl in

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:13.799
India's Kashmir province. Their motive? To
terrorize the girl's community. The

00:00:13.799 --> 00:00:16.619
accused are Hindus. At first the crime
went unnoticed.

00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:20.490
Then marchers under the banner of the
so-called Hindu Unity Platform began

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.760
protesting arrests in the case.
Two state ministers from India's ruling

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:27.480
BJP, as well as local leaders from the
opposition Congress Party, attacked the

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.679
marchers. That's when it became a
national story. Outraged Bollywood stars

00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:34.620
demanded justice on Twitter. The
crowdfunding effort for the child's

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:38.879
family quickly exceeded its target.
Outrage forced national politicians to

00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:42.870
react. Congress Party President Rahul
Gandhi led a midnight protest in Delhi.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.829
Prime Minister Narendra Modi declared
that "our daughters will definitely get

00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:50.219
justice". Yet a small minority of Hindu
extremists has attacked those

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:55.440
campaigning for justice, accusing them of
defaming Hinduism. The real defamers of

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:59.160
Hinduism are those who march in support
of alleged murderers under the banner of

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.760
the faith, and those who minimize the
crime. The Hindus who stand up for the

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:07.480
murdered child may not wear their faith
on their sleeves, but they represent its best face.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.420
How do you think people should
best represent their faith? Let us know

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.970
in your comments. Also, let us know what
other topics you'd like our scholars to

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:18.540
cover in 60 seconds, and be sure to like
and subscribe for more research and

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.799
videos from AEI.

